c","site_admin":true},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- Describe the feature you'd like. -->\n\nThe feature I am looking for is a way to export chat sessions into a plain file similar to a log file.\n\nMy primary goal is to keep a log of conversations that are complete and leverage them for generating additional resources.\n\n* User should be able to designate a file location\n    * File location should be configurable\n* User should be able to configure the file name\n    * Filename should align to session state name set by issue #459\n    * Filename should be allowed to prompt for a name if configured\n    * Filename should be allowed to assume a configured convention\n* Format of the file should be configurable\n    * Plain Text - default\n    * JSON \n    * XML \n* User should be able to decide if a closing conversation should be saved\n    * Closing a session should prompt for save\n    * Closing a session should be configured to save or not\n \n<!-- Please search existing issues to avoid creating duplicates -->\n\nIssue: #1052/#459 is similar to this. However, what I am asking for is not for session state or renaming the in-memory session state.\n\n\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"dmitrivMS","id":9581278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1ODEyNzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9581278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS","html_url":"https://github.com/dmitrivMS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu